+# WHAT MAKES A LINE A FINDING. This is the guard against the 2026-09-13 misfire: a result is only
+# a finding if it carries one of these signals -- a failure, a vulnerability, a refusal, an error.
+# `echo hello`, `ls`, `pwd`, `git status` and a green test run match none of them and so produce
+# NO fingerprint, which is what stops a repeated no-op from proving anything.
+#
